xacto: la lámina lo llama «Pizzeria Majagual» y «El Majagual»."},"Finca La Manuela - Guatapé":{"short":"Finca La Manuela","city":"Guatapé","n":0,"lat":6.2351704,"lng":-75.2215165,"_nota":"Confirmado por prensa (El Colombiano, El Tiempo, Infobae): la antigua finca en una isla del embalse; el festival ya hizo ahí su función de 2025 (p/DQdFGtVjcgo)."},"Camping La Espacial - Guatapé":{"short":"Camping La Espacial","city":"Guatapé","n":0,"lat":6.2088875,"lng":-75.163474,"_nota":"Exacto: la lámina dice «Zona de camping La Espacial»."},"Bahía Plus - Guatapé":{"short":"Bahía Plus","city":"Guatapé","n":0,"lat":6.2356097,"lng":-75.1626319,"_nota":"Aproximado: su web (bahiaplus.netlify.app) dice «Restaurante · Muelle de Guatapé»; Google no lo ubica."}},"films":[{"title":"Cine para reflejar territorio","type":"event","section":"🎪 Actividades","duration":"180 min","day":"2026-10-21","time":"09:00","day_order":0,"venue":"I.E. Sede La Piedra - Guatapé","event_kind":"taller","has_qa":false,"poster":"/assets/guatape-2026/cine-para-reflejar-territorio-v2.jpg","posterSource":"oficial","_src":{"url":"https://www.instagram.com/p/Def6fhKDSQy/","date":"2026-10-14","lamina":1},"description":"Taller en Iniciación Audiovisual.","description_lang":"es","id":"f_00c45f56ef","is_free":true},{"title":"Allá Cartas al Corazón","type":"film","section":"🪞 El Reflejo del Cine","director":"Montserrat Larqué","year":2023,"country":"Mexico","flags":"🇲🇽","duration":"101 min","genre":"Comedia","day":"2026-10-21","time":"14:00","day_order":0,"venue":"Centro Día Gerontológico - Guatapé","has_qa":false,"synopsis":"Narra la historia de Óscar, un hombre que regresa a su pueblo en Jalisco tras la inminente muerte de su padre, el cartero local. La película está protagonizada por Fátima Molina, Pablo Astiazarán y Giovanna Zacarías, explorando temas como la migración, el duelo y la ausencia. Largometraje Internacional Documental","synopsis_lang":"es","poster":"/assets/guatape-2026/alla-cartas-al-corazon.jpg","posterSource":"tmdb","_src":{"url":"https://www.instagram.com/p/Def6fhKDSQy/","date":"2026-10-14","lamina":1},"lbSlug":"alla","tmdb_id":1130565,"synopsis_en":"Faced with the imminent death of his father, the town postman, Oscar returns to Mexico for the first time and finds that he is now the only man among the handful of women who inhabit this small place where telephones and internet never reached.  While trying to return to the United States, he takes charge of the mail and thus learns the stories and wishes of the inhabitants, including a child who asks about his father's letters. Oscar writes him the long-awaited letters and begins to bond with him and with Martha, his mother. When he can finally leave, he no longer wants to and will have to decide between going back or staying and rebuilding his life.","id":"f_f1a4c7864a","is_free":true,"work_id":"w_R4JAHWBVRVWG"},{"title":"Competencia Internacional de Cortometrajes","type":"film","section":"🏅 Competencia Internacional de Cortometrajes","country":"Brasil, Argentina, España","flags":"🇧🇷🇦🇷🇪🇸","duration":"15 min","day":"2026-10-21","time":"18:00","day_order":0,"venue":"1811 Gelatería - Guatapé","has_qa":false,"_src":{"url":"https://www.instagram.com/p/Def6fhKDSQy/","date":"2026-10-14","lamina":1},"is_cortos":true,"film_list":[{"title":"Planeta Fome","director":"Édier William","country":"Brasil","flags":"🇧🇷","poster":"/assets/guatape-2026/planeta-fome.jpg","posterSource":"tmdb","lbSlug":"planeta-fome","tmdb_id":1470780,"synopsis":"En un mundo donde el hambre no es solo una consecuencia, sino una moneda de cambio, Ivani, una madre soltera, pierde su empleo y, junto a su hijo Lucca, de 8 años, es empujada a la miseria. Lo que comienza como una lucha diaria por trabajo y dignidad se transforma en una desesperada travesía por las calles de una ciudad que rinde culto a la escasez y a la desigualdad. Mientras Ivani enfrenta el rechazo y la degradación en el mercado laboral, Lucca descubre que el hambre es un sistema perverso, donde quienes la padecen son silenciados y quienes tienen el poder eligen ignorarla. Con el paso de los días, madre e hijo lo pierden todo: el hogar, los muebles, las comidas... hasta que solo les queda el uno al otro.","genre":"Drama","year":2025,"synopsis_lang":"es","duration":"15 min","work_id":"w_8GJ6SWM680BD"},{"title":"La Parada del Colectivo","country":"Argentina","flags":"🇦🇷","work_id":"w_8GJ78VY76GTS"},{"title":"Una muñeca vestida de Azul","country":"España","flags":"🇪🇸","work_id":"w_8GJ798Y2CXTY"}],"id":"f_3280bcfc20","is_free":true},{"title":"Un poeta","type":"film","section":"🎬 Película Inaugural","director":"Simón Mesa Soto","year":2025,"country":"Colombia, Germany, Sweden","flags":"🇨🇴🇩🇪🇸🇪","duration":"123 min","genre":"Comedia","day":"2026-10-21","time":"18:00","day_order":0,"venue":"Centro de Eventos Guatapé Plaza - Guatapé","has_qa":false,"synopsis":"La obsesión de Óscar Restrepo por la poesía no le ha reportado ninguna gloria. Envejecido y errático, ha sucumbido al tópico del poeta en la sombra. Conocer a Yurlady, una adolescente de origen humilde, y ayudarla a cultivar su talento trae algo de luz a sus días, pero arrastrarla al mundo de la poesía quizá no sea el camino.","synopsis_lang":"es","poster":"/assets/guatape-2026/un-poeta.jpg","posterSource":"tmdb","_src":{"url":"https://www.instagram.com/p/Def6fhKDSQy/","date":"2026-10-14","lamina":1},"premiere":"Película inaugural","lbSlug":"a-poet","tmdb_id":1465563,"synopsis_en":"An aging poet finds purpose mentoring Yurlady, a talented teen, though exposing her to the poetry scene might be unwise. His own poetic pursuits led nowhere, leaving him a stereotypical obscure writer.","title_en":"A Poet","id":"f_6b27408f04","is_free":true,"work_id":"w_R4J6CZM22Y88"},{"title":"Ipatu","type":"film","section":"🤝 Muestra de Cine Comunitario Colombiano","duration":"15 min","day":"2026-10-21","time":"18:00","day_order":0,"venue":"Parque Principal - Guatapé","sala":"Domo","has_qa":false,"_src":{"url":"https://www